WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.600
The ideal text rarely comes out on the first attempt.

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:21.600
Two simple techniques improve the result a lot: include one or two short examples of the style you want (without other people's private data) and iterate by asking for specific changes («cut it to 60 words», «use a polite but direct tone», «point out which details are missing before you write»).

3
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:28.400
Goal: improve a mediocre draft with your own examples and specific follow-up requests.

4
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:41.700
The AI returns a 400-word complaint email about your rent that reads like a Victorian novel. Your task: decide how to iterate to get a clear, useful message.

5
00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:52.000
Hint: there is no need to open another chat and get annoyed; state the length, the tone and give a short example.

6
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.200
Now do the lesson exercises. If you are unsure, watch this video again.
